{"id":57,"date":"2026-03-24T14:56:41","date_gmt":"2026-03-24T14:56:41","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-03-24T15:17:35","modified_gmt":"2026-03-24T15:17:35","slug":"by-price-range","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/by-price-range\/","title":{"rendered":"Browse by Price Range"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group page-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/price-range.png\" alt=\"Price comparison\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>Find psychic services that fit your budget. All prices shown are typical per-minute rates as of March 2026.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Budget-Friendly: Under $3\/min<\/h2>\n\n\n<p>Great options for first-time users or those exploring different readers. Platforms like Keen, PathForward, and Oranum offer competitive introductory rates and free trial minutes. Many independent readers on these platforms offer chat readings starting at $1.99\/min.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mid-Range: $3\u20138\/min<\/h2>\n\n\n<p>The sweet spot for quality readings at reasonable prices. Most top-rated readers on Kasamba, Purple Garden, and Psychic Source fall in this range. Expect experienced readers with strong specialties and verified track records.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Premium: $8\u201315\/min<\/h2>\n\n\n<p>Premium-tier readers on California Psychics and select Kasamba advisors. These are typically the most experienced and highest-rated readers with extensive client histories and specialised expertise.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Flat-Rate Sessions<\/h2>\n\n\n<p>Some platforms and independent readers offer flat-rate sessions (e.g., $30 for 15 minutes, $75 for 30 minutes). This can be more cost-effective for longer readings and eliminates the pressure of watching the clock.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Free Introductory Offers<\/h2>\n\n\n<p>Many platforms offer free minutes for new users: Kasamba (3 free minutes + 70% off), Keen (5 minutes for $1), Psychic Source ($1\/min for first reading), and Purple Garden (credits for new signups). These are excellent ways to test a reader before committing.<\/p>\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Find psychic services that fit your budget. All prices shown are typical per-minute rates as of March 2026. Budget-Friendly: Under $3\/min Great options for first-time users or those exploring different readers. Platforms like Keen, PathForward, and Oranum offer competitive introductory rates and free trial minutes. Many independent readers on these platforms offer chat readings starting [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-57","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.2 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\r\n<title>Browse by Price Range - Psychic Review Directory<\/title>\r\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\r\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http:\/\/psychic-review-directorycom.local\/by-price-range\/\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Browse by Price Range - Psychic Review Directory\" \/>\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Find psychic services that fit your budget. All prices shown are typical per-minute rates as of March 2026. Budget-Friendly: Under $3\/min Great options for first-time users or those exploring different readers. Platforms like Keen, 